[00:00.000] 作词 : Maria BC
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Maria BC
[00:09.648] Night comes down to charm the clock
[00:18.092] Open up my mouth, pull the roots out
[00:22.561] Till I'm howling in your arms
[00:25.805]
[00:28.623] The dream gets so vivid just before it ends
[00:37.066] I'm hanging on your voice, hanging on your words
[00:42.133] Hanging 'round your neck
[00:45.059]
[00:47.268] Like the pull of the water, strange control
[00:57.719] Deep in your voice, crackling coals
[01:05.795]
[01:09.716] Now these bells are ringing
[01:14.193] The morning breaks and takes control
[01:19.265] Dreams white out around me
[01:23.782] I rub my eyes
[01:27.045]
[01:32.325] And in the light, I try to remember
[01:42.161] In the light
[01:43.955]
[01:45.821] I wait for the night to come
[01:54.037] Open up my heart, open up the past
[01:58.965] Loosen up my tongue
[02:01.977]
[02:04.275] When I'm done spending the day working off some debt
[02:13.043] I'm hanging on your voice, hanging on your words
[02:18.112] Hanging 'round your neck
[02:21.069]
[02:23.235] Like the pull of the water, strange control
[02:33.665] Deep in your eyes, two dim coals
[02:41.895]
[02:45.739] Now my head is ringing
[02:50.280] I don't feel right, this isn't home
[02:55.272] Sunlight hits the concrete
[02:59.816] I shield my eyes
[03:03.303]
[03:04.843] Draw back, draw the blinds
[03:12.077] Buy more time
[03:16.877] Fool, you can't hide
[03:21.611] Sobering up in a stranger's room
[03:26.482] Back on the edge of the bed I helped untie you
[03:33.608] Loose ends fed through the narrow eye of moonlight
[03:43.264] You said, "It's always the same, I guess
[03:50.525] Losing my mind for the ones I love
[03:55.293] Giving in to what I can't give up
[03:59.819] Be damned my pride"
[04:02.828]
[04:05.976] And in the light, I try to remember
[04:15.736] In the light
